{
  "_comment": [
    "Job-assignment map for the parallel portable fan-out (ci-portable.yml).",
    "Every step in validate's constructed portable-only plan is assigned to exactly one",
    "hosted job here. ci/check-shard-coverage.sh asks validate for that plan and fails",
    "closed if this map drifts, so lane merging, deduplication, or edge changes cannot",
    "silently create a second hosted definition.",
    "That wording is deliberate: this comment previously said coverage == the trusted DAG",
    "'by construction' while the guard's only caller was .github/workflows/ci-portable.yml.",
    "A correct fail-closed guard with no live reader is indistinguishable from no guard,",
    "and two nodes drifted out of this map behind it -- check.dbt_runtime_abi (corrected",
    "2026-08-21 by 3b6cd503cc) and check.exit_status_class (corrected here).",
    "Node commands and resource policy live only in validate's constructed plan; shards",
    "reference steps by group.job key and execute them via ci/run-node.sh."
  ],
